3. Print the Multiplication Table of a Number
Pseudocode
START
Input N
FOR i = 1 TO 10
    Print N × i = N*i
END FOR
STOP
Flowchart
          ┌─────────┐
          │  START  │
          └────┬────┘
               │
          Input N
               │
               ▼
            i = 1
               │
               ▼
          i <= 10 ?
          ┌───┴───┐
         Yes      No
          │        │
          ▼        ▼
 Print N × i = N*i STOP
          │
          ▼
        i = i + 1
          │
          └───────────┐
                      │
                      └──────► Back to `i <= 10?`
4. Take 2 Numbers as Inputs and Find their HCF and LCM
Pseudocode
START
Input A, B

HCF = GCD(A, B)
LCM = (A × B) / HCF

Print HCF
Print LCM

STOP
Flowchart
        ┌─────────┐
        │  START  │
        └────┬────┘
             │
      Input A, B
             │
             ▼
      Find HCF (GCD)
             │
             ▼
   LCM = (A × B) / HCF
             │
             ▼
  Print HCF and LCM
             │
             ▼
        ┌────────┐
        │  STOP  │
        └────────┘
5. Keep Taking Numbers Until the User Enters 'x', Then Print the Sum
Pseudocode
START
Sum = 0

REPEAT
    Input value
    IF value == 'x'
        BREAK
    ELSE
        Sum = Sum + value
    END IF
UNTIL FALSE

Print Sum
STOP
Flowchart
          ┌─────────┐
          │  START  │
          └────┬────┘
               │
          Sum = 0
               │
               ▼
        Input Value
               │
               ▼
      Is Value = 'x' ?
         ┌─────┴─────┐
        Yes         No
         │            │
         ▼            ▼
    Print Sum    Sum = Sum + Value
         │            │
         ▼            │
      ┌───────┐       │
      │ STOP  │◄──────┘
      └───────┘


